.SH NAME
frontend/node_modules/vaul Directory Reference
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
https://github.com/emilkowalski/vaul/assets/36730035/fdf8c5e8-ade8-433b-8bb0-4ce10e722516

.PP
Vaul is an unstyled drawer component for React that can be used as a Dialog replacement on tablet and mobile devices\&. You can read about why and how it was built \fRhere\fP\&.
.SS "Usage"
To start using the library, install it in your project:,

.PP
.PP
.nf
npm install vaul
.fi
.PP

.PP
Use the drawer in your app\&.

.PP
.PP
.nf
import { Drawer } from 'vaul';

function MyComponent() {
  return (
    <Drawer\&.Root>
      <Drawer\&.Trigger>Open</Drawer\&.Trigger>
      <Drawer\&.Portal>
        <Drawer\&.Content>
          <p>Content</p>
        </Drawer\&.Content>
        <Drawer\&.Overlay />
      </Drawer\&.Portal>
    </Drawer\&.Root>
  );
}
.fi
.PP
